can check
  requires a + b * c - d / e = f
  requires (a + b) * c >= 10 or not g and h
  requires x in (HKD 1, HKD 2, HKD 3)
  requires sum of parts <= amount
  requires count of parts > 0 and 各部分 數目 < 17
  requires 30日內 or within 30 days
  requires overdue 3 days or 7 days before due or 到期前 7日
  requires 2027-01-06 < due and 5% > rate and "text" = note and yes
